---
// Hidden page: not in the nav, not in the sitemap, not in search.
// In this album, 5am never comes — 4:59 rolls back to 0:00.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Base title="5:00 — SHINYA / 深夜" description="この時間は存在しない。" localized={false}>
  <section class="hero notfound" data-pagefind-ignore>
    <h1 class="jp-title glitch" data-text="5:00">5:00</h1>
    <p class="en-title">This hour does not exist</p>
    <p class="tagline">
      よく見つけたね。でも、ここには何もない。<br />
      このアルバムに朝５時は来ない — 4:59の次は 0:00。<br />
      이 앨범에 아침 5시는 오지 않아. 4시 59분 다음은 0시.<br />
      The loop closes before dawn.
    </p>
    <p class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn" href={`${base}/music/4am-on-repeat/`}>← 4:59</a>
      <a class="btn" href={`${base}/music/poison-is-fine/`}>0:00 →</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
